# LLM-HypatiaX-PAPERS

[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)
[![Papers](https://img.shields.io/badge/Papers-4-green.svg)](papers/)
[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.8+-yellow.svg)](requirements.txt)

**Multi-paper repository for HypatiaX research publications**

This repository contains multiple academic papers, shared datasets, analysis code, and tools for the HypatiaX project - a hybrid symbolic-neural system for scientific equation discovery.

---

## 📚 Repository Structure

```
LLM-HypatiaX-PAPERS/
├── 📄 papers/                      # Individual papers (self-contained)
│   ├── 2025-JMLR/                 # Hybrid Symbolic-Neural System
│   ├── 2025-NeurIPS/              # Scaling Laws for Symbolic Regression
│   ├── 2026-ICML/                 # Multi-Modal Equation Discovery
│   └── 2025-AAAI/                 # Explainable Scientific Discovery
│
├── 🔄 shared/                      # Shared resources across papers
│   ├── data/                      # Common datasets (127 tests, 5 systems)
│   ├── code/                      # Shared analysis utilities
│   ├── figures/                   # Reusable figure components
│   └── docs/                      # Common documentation
│
├── 📋 templates/                   # Templates for new papers
│   ├── jmlr/                      # JMLR template
│   ├── neurips/                   # NeurIPS template
│   ├── icml/                      # ICML template
│   └── aaai/                      # AAAI template
│
├── 🔧 tools/                       # Repository management scripts
│   ├── create_new_paper.sh        # Create new paper directory
│   ├── build_all_papers.sh        # Build all papers
│   └── sync_shared_data.sh        # Sync shared resources
│
└── .github/workflows/             # CI/CD automation
