## 🛠️ Repository Tools

### Create New Paper
```bash
bash tools/create_new_paper.sh <directory_name> <venue> <year>
```
Creates complete directory structure with:
- LaTeX template for the venue
- Standard folder organization
- Build scripts and Makefile
- README template

### Build All Papers
```bash
bash tools/build_all_papers.sh
```
Compiles all papers and generates a summary report.

### Sync Shared Data
```bash
bash tools/sync_shared_data.sh
```
Updates shared data references across all papers.

### Check Citation Consistency
```bash
python tools/check_citations.py
```
Ensures consistent citations across papers.

