## 📖 Working with Papers

### Individual Paper Structure
Each paper directory follows this structure:

```
papers/YEAR-VENUE/
├── paper/              # LaTeX source
│   ├── main.tex
│   ├── bibliography.bib
│   ├── <venue>.sty    # Venue style file
│   └── Makefile
├── figures/            
│   ├── pdf/           # Final figures
│   └── source/        # Generation scripts
├── tables/             # LaTeX table files
├── data/               # Paper-specific data
├── src/                # Analysis code
├── scripts/            
│   └── build.sh       # Build automation
├── submission/         # Submission package
├── compiled/           # Version history
│   ├── v1.0/
│   ├── v1.1/
│   └── final/
└── README.md           # Paper-specific documentation
```

### Paper-Specific Workflows

**Generate figures:**
```bash
cd papers/2025-JMLR
bash scripts/generate_all_figures.sh
```

**Run experiments:**
```bash
cd papers/2025-JMLR
bash scripts/run_all_experiments.sh
```

**Create submission package:**
```bash
cd papers/2025-JMLR
bash scripts/create_submission.sh
```

